OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies high-speed race
OL,4,Abefore fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who was just behind a car
OL,7,Fwhich crashed into and killed a mother
OL,8,Fand daughter on their way to the
OL,9,Fyoungster's nursery has denied the
OL,10,Fvehicles were racing.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and four-year-old
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were struck by an Audi TT
OL,14,FRS on the pavement on Scott Hall Road
OL,15,Fin Leeds on 16 January 2023.
OL,17,FJasskamal Riyat had been driving his
OL,18,FBMW 1 Series closely behind. He had
OL,19,Ffilmed the 560hp Audi, which later
OL,20,Fstruck the pair, on his phone, because
OL,21,Fhe "liked the sound of the souped up
OL,22,Fengine".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
